> build-house-style · deepseek-v4.1-flash:1017-cloud
Implemented the auto-hiding bar in `internal/docker/appbar.go`:

- Scroll down past a small delta hides the bar (slides up); scrolling up — or returning to the top — brings it back.
- While hidden, a small "Once" tab with an `H` hint sits fixed in the top right; clicking it or pressing `H` restores the bar.
- `H` now toggles instead of permanently hiding, and the tab is excluded from the content cross-fade.
- Respects `prefers-reduced-motion` and `prefers-reduced-transparency`.

Tests added for the scroll behavior, restore tab, and toggle key in `internal/docker/appbar_test.go`.

Verification:
- `go test ./internal/...` — pass
- `golangci-lint run` — `0 issues`
